ei zu ergreifen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_007_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, im Artikel schreibe ich: die Opposition behaupte, die Zahlen seien geschönt.","speaker":"Ortrud","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_007_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Gut, und die Regierungsseite? Wie gibst du deren Position wieder?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_007_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ein Sprecher erklärt, alle Angaben seien korrekt und unabhängig geprüft worden.","speaker":"Ortrud","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_007_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"So bleibst du neutral, ohne selbst Partei zu ergreifen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_007_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Die Regierung erklärt, die Zahlen seien geprüft worden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo fragt, wie du im Artikel die Regierungsseite wiedergibst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Die Opposition behauptet, die Zahlen seien geschönt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-07-konjunktiv-i","level":"C